<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Smith Barney cuts National Semiconductor Corp.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Smith Barney cuts National Semiconductor Corp.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney analyst James Barlage cut his rating on National Semiconductor Corp to outperform from buy, a source at the brokerage said.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>-- E. Auchard, Wall Street bureau, 212-859-1736</p>
</text>
